The above (using aliasing) might work possibly only with the recent
alsa-lib.  With the older alsa-lib, you'd need to define the following
in /etc/asound.conf:

pcm.!default {
	type plug
	slave.pcm {
		type hw
		card 0
	}
}

This will override the default PCM.


